<Layout
  title="Equipment Return Policy"
  description="Read the Imaging Uganda/Africa return policy for equipment orders."
  pubDate={new Date()}
>
  <p>This policy applies to equipment purchased from Imaging Uganda/Africa. Please contact us within 7 days of delivery if your order arrives damaged, faulty, or is not the item you ordered.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>Eligible returns</h2>
    <p>We accept return requests for equipment that is damaged or faulty on arrival, or when we have supplied the wrong item. We do not accept returns because you have changed your mind or no longer need the equipment.</p>
    <p>Please keep the equipment, accessories, and original packaging together while we review your request. Do not use, install, or attempt to repair equipment that appears damaged or faulty before contacting us.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How to request a return</h2>
    <p>Contact us within 7 days of delivery at <a href="mailto:alexmradiology@gmail.com">alexmradiology@gmail.com</a> or <a href="tel:+256786467098">+256 786 467 098</a>. Include your order details, a description of the issue, and clear photos where relevant. We will explain the next steps and arrange the return.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Return shipping and resolution</h2>
    <p>We cover the return shipping costs for approved returns under this policy. Once the equipment has been returned and inspected, we will confirm whether a refund or replacement will be provided.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Consumer rights and warranties</h2>
    <p>This policy does not limit any rights you may have under applicable consumer protection laws. Any manufacturer or seller warranty is separate; please contact us if you need help with a warranty claim.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
